      "description": "<p>Pavetta attempts a single Intimidation check to Demoralize and applies the result to every opponent within 30 feet. Additionally, she automatically alerts any allies within 100 feet that are able to hear her to her need for assistance. The baroness can't Scream for 1 round.</p>",
